# Runtime Dev Dev Notes 13 — Runtime Lifecycle Session Reset Coordinator v1

## Branch

```text
runtime-lifecycle-modularization-v1-session-reset-coordinator
```

## Status

```text
STAGED / SANDBOX-MOCK VERIFIED
```

These notes record the behavior-preserving session-reset coordinator extraction from `inference.mjs`.

## Source base

Active formatted source truth used for this branch:

```text
runtime-dev-repo-modularization.zip
```

The source base already contained the completed modularization seams:

```text
nativeOperationPolicy.mjs / docs/dev-notes.09
runtimeRequestSettlement.mjs / docs/dev-notes.10
runtimeLifecycleState.mjs / docs/dev-notes.11
nativeBoundaryCoordinator.mjs / docs/dev-notes.12
```

## Purpose

Extract parent-side `resetSession()` orchestration into a narrow coordinator module while preserving the existing runtime behavior exactly.

## Files added

```text
runtimeSessionResetCoordinator.mjs
docs/dev-notes.13
```

## Files modified

```text
inference.mjs
tests/smokeTestContextCreationCancelBoundary.mjs
tests/smokeTestContextCreationRetry.mjs
tests/smokeTestDrainShutdown.mjs
tests/smokeTestInitThenResetWithoutPriorPrompt.mjs
tests/smokeTestNativeOperationHardStopPolicy.mjs
tests/smokeTestWorkerNativeCancellationBoundary.mjs
tests/smokeTestWorkerOperationSerialization.mjs
```

## Behavior moved

Moved from `inference.mjs` into `runtimeSessionResetCoordinator.mjs`:

```text
resetSession() runtime-health check
runtimeResetting rejection
runtimeShuttingDown rejection
native hard-stop config resolution
existing session-reset waiter handling
session reset waiter creation
sessionsResetting mutation at reset start
session-scoped scheduler.cancelBySession() cancellation flow
parent cancellation notification for canceled requests
worker cancel messages for canceled requests
stream cancel / traceCanceled / done rejection / traceDelete order
worker reset_session message
waitForNativeOperationBoundary() call for resetSession
session-scoped timeout marker and timeout error
```

The public API export remains in `inference.mjs`:

```js
export async function resetSession(sessionId = "default") {
    return resetSessionCoordinator(..., sessionId);
}
```

## Behavior intentionally not moved

The following intentionally remain in `inference.mjs`:

```text
public API exports
prompt admission checks
worker message router reset_done handling
worker message router session-reset error handling
initModel()
ensureModelReady()
resetModel()
shutdownRuntime()
model reset waiter handling
shutdown waiter handling
scheduler creation/ownership
workerBridge ownership
request creation
cancelPrompt()
shutdown cancellation helper
model reset cancellation helper
assertNoSessionResetInProgress()
```

The following were intentionally not changed:

```text
llama_worker/llama.mjs
scheduler.mjs
workerBridge.mjs
runtimeRequestSettlement.mjs
runtimeLifecycleState.mjs
nativeBoundaryCoordinator.mjs
nativeOperationPolicy.mjs
configOverride.mjs
retry/profile planning
public API shape
prompt/output semantics
worker message protocol
```

## Preserved session reset invariants

```text
resetSession timeout does not mark global runtime unhealthy.
resetSession timeout does not call markRuntimeUnhealthy().
resetSession timeout does not terminate or recreate the worker.
resetSession timeout marks waiter.timedOut = true.
resetSession timeout leaves that session blocked until worker reset completion/error cleanup or process restart.
Late reset_done after timeout clears the session block without resolving the timed-out caller.
Late reset error after timeout clears the session block without rejecting the timed-out caller again.
Concurrent resetSession(sessionId) while active returns the existing promise.
Concurrent resetSession(sessionId) after timeout throws "Session is resetting: <sessionId>".
Prompt admission remains session-scoped for sessionsResetting.
Model reset and shutdown still reject while an active session reset is in progress.
```

## Cancellation-order preservation

For requests canceled by session reset, the branch preserves the existing order:

```text
scheduler.cancelBySession(sessionId)
notifyRequestsCancellationRequested(canceled, reason)
for each canceled request:
    sendToWorker({ type: "cancel", id, sessionId, reason })
    cancelStream(req)
    traceCanceled(req)
    req.rejectDone(new Error(reason))
    traceDelete(req.id)
```

No new cancel-channel closure was added to the session-reset cancellation loop in this branch.

## Import direction

Preserved import direction:

```text
inference.mjs -> runtimeSessionResetCoordinator.mjs
```

Avoided forbidden direction:

```text
runtimeSessionResetCoordinator.mjs does not import inference.mjs
```

`runtimeSessionResetCoordinator.mjs` receives its dependencies through a narrow context object from `inference.mjs`.

